    fix(mode-legs): _kept_leg reads the plan's kept minutes against every minimum
    
    need > 0 guarded a comparison that cannot hold at a minimum of 0 (the
    kept minutes are never negative), so its CMP_BOUND twin was an
    equivalent mutant no check could kill, and it hid max(at, 0.0) in
    _kept_minutes from every check. Without it the line reads the plan for
    both minimums, and the floor at 0 is what keeps a 0 minimum from holding
    a leg: a new check enters heating at a heating minimum of 0 inside a
    hot-water step. The two pins on the old line text (BOOLOP, GUARD_OFF
    d7e66a4a) go with it: the BOOLOP site no longer exists, and the
    GUARD_OFF site is re-pinned under its new anchor by mutation-autofix.

